      "bio": "<div align=\"center\">\n\n<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->\n<!--                         HERO SECTION                         -->\n<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->\n\n<a href=\"https://i.postimg.cc/pXXcfjRk/Test.png\" target=\"_blank\">\n  <img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/pXXcfjRk/Test.png\" alt=\"Vanitas Hero Banner\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border-radius: 16px;\" />\n</a>\n\n<br><br>\n\n<!-- TYPING SVG -->\n<img src=\"https://readme-typing-svg.demolab.com?font=Fira+Code&weight=700&size=28&duration=3000&pause=800&color=8A2BE2&center=true&vCenter=true&width=600&lines=%E2%9D%96+%F0%9D%91%BD%F0%9D%92%82%F0%9D%92%8F%F0%9D%92%8A%F0%9D%92%95%F0%9D%92%82%F0%9D%92%94+%E2%9D%96;Software+Developer+%E2%80%A2+AI+%E2%80%A2+Bots+%E2%80%A2+Automation+%E2%80%A2+Web\" alt=\"Typing Animation\" />\n\n<br><br>\n\n<!-- BADGES ROW -->\n<a href=\"https://github.com/sovereignempirex-ux\">\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/GitHub-181717?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white&labelColor=181717\" alt=\"GitHub\" />\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://nexora-yx2o.vercel.app\">\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/NEXORA-8A2BE2?style=for-the-badge&logo=vercel&logoColor=white&labelColor=8A2BE2\" alt=\"NEXORA\" />\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/HC2wSQpru\">\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-5865F2?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white&labelColor=5865F2\" alt=\"Discord\" />\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://wa.me/201283073813\">\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/WhatsApp-25D366?style=for-the-badge&logo=whatsapp&logoColor=white&labelColor=25D366\" alt=\"WhatsApp\" />\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029Vb8glFqJkK7EdMYrao0K\">\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Channel-128C7E?style=for-the-badge&logo=whatsapp&logoColor=white&labelColor=128C7E\" alt=\"WhatsApp Channel\" />\n</a>\n\n<br><br>\n\n<!-- PROFILE VIEWS -->\n<img src=\"https://komarev.com/ghpvc/?username=sovereignempirex-ux&style=for-the-badge&color=8A2BE2&label=PROFILE+VIEWS\" alt=\"Profile Views\" />\n\n<br><br>\n\n> **\"Building systems, not just commands.\"**\n\n<br>\n\n<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->\n<!--                    ABOUT THE DEVELOPER                       -->\n<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->\n\n## <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tarikul-Islam-Anik/Animated-Fluent-Emojis/master/Emojis/People/Technologist.png\" alt=\"Technologist\" width=\"30\" /> About Me\n\nI'm **Omar**, a Software Developer passionate about building complete systems and scalable architectures. I don't just write isolated commands — I design, develop, and deploy full-stack solutions that solve real problems.\n\n### What I Do\n\n| Domain | Focus |\n|--------|-------|\n| <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tarikul-Islam-Anik/Animated-Fluent-Emojis/master/Emojis/Objects/Gear.png\" width=\"20\" /> **Software Development** | Full-stack applications & system design |\n| <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tarikul-Islam-Anik/Animated-Fluent-Emojis/master/Emojis/Symbols/Brain.png\" width=\"20\" /> **Artificial Intelligence** | AI integrations & intelligent automation |\n| <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tarikul-Islam-Anik/Animated-Fluent-Emojis/master/Emojis/Objects/Robot.png\" width=\"20\" /> **Automation** | Workflow automation & bot systems |\n| <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tarikul-Islam-Anik/Animated-Fluent-Emojis/master/Emojis/Objects/Server.png\" width=\"20\" /> **Backend Development** | APIs, microservices & server architecture |\n| <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tarikul-Islam-Anik/Animated-Fluent-Emojis/master/Emojis/Objects/Globe%20with%20Meridians.png\" width=\"20\" /> **Web Development** | Modern web apps & responsive interfaces |\n| <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tarikul-Islam-Anik/Animated-Fluent-Emojis/master/Emojis/Objects/Link.png\" width=\"20\" /> **APIs** | RESTful APIs & third-party integrations |\n| <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tarikul-Islam-Anik/Animated-Fluent-Emojis/master/Emojis/Objects/Robot.png\" width=\"20\" /> **Bots** | WhatsApp, Discord & automation bots |\n| <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tarikul-Islam-Anik/Animated-Fluent-Emojis/master/Emojis/Objects/Floppy%20Disk.png\" width=\"20\" /> **Databases** | SQL & NoSQL data architecture |\n| <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tarikul-Islam-Anik/Animated-Fluent-Emojis/master/Emojis/Objects/Building%20Construction.png\" width=\"20\" /> **System Architecture** | Scalable & maintainable system design |\n| <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tarikul-Islam-Anik/Animated-Fluent-Emojis/master/Emojis/Objects/Hammer%20and%20Wrench.png\" width=\"20\" /> **Developer Tools** | CLI tools, compilers & dev utilities |\n\n<br>\n\n<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->\n<!--                       TECH STACK                             -->\n<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->\n\n## <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tarikul-Islam-Anik/Animated-Fluent-Emojis/master/Emojis/Objects/Hammer%20and%20Wrench.png\" alt=\"Tools\" width=\"30\" /> Tech Stack\n\n### Languages\n<p>\n  <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/JavaScript-F7DF1E?style=flat-square&logo=javascript&logoColor=black\" alt=\"JavaScript\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.python.org/\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Python-3776AB?style=flat-square&logo=python&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Python\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/bash/\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Bash-4EAA25?style=flat-square&logo=gnu-bash&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Bash\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/HTML-E34F26?style=flat-square&logo=html5&logoColor=white\" alt=\"HTML\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CSS-1572B6?style=flat-square&logo=css3&logoColor=white\" alt=\"CSS\" /></a>\n</p>\n\n### Backend & Runtime\n<p>\n  <a href=\"https://nodejs.org/\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Node.js-339933?style=flat-square&logo=nodedotjs&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Node.js\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"https://expressjs.com/\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Express.js-000000?style=flat-square&logo=express&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Express.js\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/WhiskeySockets/Baileys\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Baileys-25D366?style=flat-square&logo=whatsapp&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Baileys\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"https://axios-http.com/\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Axios-5A29E4?style=flat-square&logo=axios&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Axios\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"https://restfulapi.net/\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/REST%20APIs-FF6C37?style=flat-square&logo=postman&logoColor=white\" alt=\"REST APIs\" /></a>\n</p>\n\n### Media & Processing\n<p>\n  <a href=\"https://ffmpeg.org/\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/FFmpeg-007808?style=flat-square&logo=ffmpeg&logoColor=white\" alt=\"FFmpeg\" /></a>\n</p>\n\n### Databases\n<p>\n  <a href=\"https://www.sqlite.org/\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/SQLite-003B57?style=flat-square&logo=sqlite&logoColor=white\" alt=\"SQLite\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.mongodb.com/\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/MongoDB-47A248?style=flat-square&logo=mongodb&logoColor=white\" alt=\"MongoDB\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"https://firebase.google.com/\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Firebase-FFCA28?style=flat-square&logo=firebase&logoColor=black\" alt=\"Firebase\" /></a>\n</p>\n\n### DevOps & Tools\n<p>\n  <a href=\"https://git-scm.com/\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Git-F05032?style=flat-square&logo=git&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Git\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/GitHub-181717?style=flat-square&logo=github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"GitHub\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.linux.org/\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Linux-FCC624?style=flat-square&log",
